            "block_content": "Section 8. Upon the expiration of any approved leave of absence without pay, except as provided in Section 6 above and in Article 22, Section 7, the employee is entitled to return to a position in the same or equivalent classification within the agency, subject to the furlough provisions of Article 25, Seniority.",
