        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Section 9. It is understood by both parties that the provisions of Sections 5, 6, 7 and 8 are consistent with the Family and Medical Leave Act of 1993, 29 USC Section 2601 et seq and that leave granted in accordance with Sections 5, 6, 7, and 8 shall be designated as leave under the provisions of the Act.",
